{"title":"Accessories","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"drop-fire","title":"Drop Fire","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDrop Design Fire is a gorgeous design fireplace that follows the shape of the Drop spa pool, which is awarded with the Finnish Design Deed of the Year. The high-quality Design Fire, designed and handmade in Finland, is a true eye-catcher and an impressive design element for your patio or backyard. The fireplace is uniquely versatile and can be used outside with firewood or coal. The Design Fire comes with a square-shaped black cover that transforms the fireplace into a table and keeps water and trash away when the fireplace is not in use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Drop Fire","offer_id":48742380044612,"sku":"","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Bio ethanol burner","offer_id":48742380142916,"sku":"","price":750.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/files\/drop_matte-black-fire-forest-1_46e6caff-db26-4177-91c4-75429ddbd93c.jpg?v=1718743499"}],"url":"https:\/\/heatica.com\/en-at\/collections\/accessories.oembed","provider":"Heatica","version":"1.0","type":"link"}